Description: hybrid classical and post-quantum research VPN client
 PQ-VPN is a deployable research/prototype Linux VPN using X25519 and
 ML-KEM-768 session establishment, a pinned static ML-KEM-768 server identity,
 classical Ed25519 client authentication, and AES-256-GCM traffic protection.
